      "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request correctly enables Weave tracing for `SingleTurnAgentLoop` by adding the `@rollout_trace_op` decorator to its `run` method. This change aligns its behavior with `ToolAgentLoop` and fixes the issue where prompt and response text were not being decoded in traces when `token2text=True`. The implementation is straightforward and correct. I have reviewed the changes and have not identified any issues.",
